West: a mossling warren, and a hollow where lights float. East: kobolds. On the floor: a goblin camp. Up the west wall: an old crypt. Up the east wall: the orc hall. The warlord's temple lies behind the rockfall, and the way in runs through the orc hall.\"",[_[28]]=_[24],text="WHAT WE KNOW\
